[14047]="7006001B\n1\tRescue Zhélruka Warriors at Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should rescue Zhélruka Warriors at Tûr Fúar.\n2\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should rescue Zhélruka Warriors at Tûr Fúar.\t\n",
[14048]="700602E0\n1\tCollect the stolen expedition supplies at Tûr Fúar\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should collect the stolen expedition supplies found at Tûr Fúar.\n2\tCollect stolen expedition supplies (total: 12)\tTûr Fúar, the Drearspire, can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should collect the stolen expedition supplies found at Tûr Fúar.\n3\tPlace the expedition supplies in the supply chest at Grúmachath\tGrúmachath can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should bring the expedition supplies to Grúmachath.\n",
